    "name": "Star Words - The Board Game",
    "steam_appid": 3539520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Star Words \u2013 The board game</strong>&quot; is a collection of <strong>word games</strong> for the <strong>whole family</strong>: gather as many people as you can around <strong>a</strong> <strong>single device</strong> and have fun <strong>together</strong>! There is no limit to the number of players who can participate: even in competitive games, organize into teams to <strong>double the fun</strong>! The game is <strong>turn-based</strong>, so only <strong>one</strong> <strong>controller</strong> is needed: it will be passed between players (it is also fully playable with a <strong>mouse</strong> and <strong>keyboard</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/7acd9381b3a29cc5a143a24e2055d68f.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>core mechanism</strong> of the game involves moving <strong>spaceships</strong> on a grid: to do this, you need to find as many <strong>words</strong> as possible related to a <strong>category</strong> with the assigned (or chosen) <strong>initial</strong> <strong>letter</strong>. With this simple mechanic, various <strong>game modes</strong> are available, both <strong>cooperative</strong> and <strong>competitive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/daeaf227f6ac75e3e3164ab97fa22a14.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the galaxy and face<strong> twelve missions</strong> in a <strong>cooperative adventure</strong>: form a <strong>single team</strong> that makes decisions together to <strong>defeat a monstrous alien race</strong>! Everyone will be active players, not only in decision-making but also in finding the <strong>words</strong> that will allow you to move the <strong>spaceships</strong> and <strong>complete the objective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/4b9323269914aaaf29b1b46d77d35a6f.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Planet Rush</strong>, a <strong>competitive mode</strong>, you'll split into <strong>teams</strong> (up to <strong>twelve</strong>) and compete to be the first to <strong>bring a set number of ships to your planet</strong>, with the <strong>same core mechanics</strong>. For the best gameplay experience, it's recommended to have fewer but larger teams\u2014but the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/1d05196406ee471ca6223fca259f751e.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all: <strong>Galaxy Grand Prix</strong>, <strong>Space Snakes</strong>, <strong>Tic-Tac-Galaxy</strong>\u2026 So, what are you waiting for? Hop on board and explore a <strong>galaxy of words</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>Star Words \u2013 The board game</strong>&quot; is a collection of <strong>word games</strong> for the <strong>whole family</strong>: gather as many people as you can around <strong>a</strong> <strong>single device</strong> and have fun <strong>together</strong>! There is no limit to the number of players who can participate: even in competitive games, organize into teams to <strong>double the fun</strong>! The game is <strong>turn-based</strong>, so only <strong>one</strong> <strong>controller</strong> is needed: it will be passed between players (it is also fully playable with a <strong>mouse</strong> and <strong>keyboard</strong>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/7acd9381b3a29cc5a143a24e2055d68f.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>core mechanism</strong> of the game involves moving <strong>spaceships</strong> on a grid: to do this, you need to find as many <strong>words</strong> as possible related to a <strong>category</strong> with the assigned (or chosen) <strong>initial</strong> <strong>letter</strong>. With this simple mechanic, various <strong>game modes</strong> are available, both <strong>cooperative</strong> and <strong>competitive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/daeaf227f6ac75e3e3164ab97fa22a14.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save the galaxy and face<strong> twelve missions</strong> in a <strong>cooperative adventure</strong>: form a <strong>single team</strong> that makes decisions together to <strong>defeat a monstrous alien race</strong>! Everyone will be active players, not only in decision-making but also in finding the <strong>words</strong> that will allow you to move the <strong>spaceships</strong> and <strong>complete the objective</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/4b9323269914aaaf29b1b46d77d35a6f.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Planet Rush</strong>, a <strong>competitive mode</strong>, you'll split into <strong>teams</strong> (up to <strong>twelve</strong>) and compete to be the first to <strong>bring a set number of ships to your planet</strong>, with the <strong>same core mechanics</strong>. For the best gameplay experience, it's recommended to have fewer but larger teams\u2014but the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539520/extras/1d05196406ee471ca6223fca259f751e.avif?t=1746953470\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And that's not all: <strong>Galaxy Grand Prix</strong>, <strong>Space Snakes</strong>, <strong>Tic-Tac-Galaxy</strong>\u2026 So, what are you waiting for? Hop on board and explore a <strong>galaxy of words</strong>!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Star Words - The board game&quot; is a collection of local multiplayer word games. Defeat monstrous aliens with your friends in a cooperative adventure or challenge each other in space battles in front of a single device in a galaxy of words!",
